WEBVTT

00:03:27.119 --> 00:03:30.790
Could we imagine coming
to such a global consensus,

00:03:30.831 --> 00:03:35.836
radically reversing
all of our existing assumptions?

00:03:37.255 --> 00:03:38.506
What would it take?

00:03:39.757 --> 00:03:41.092
What would it look like?

00:03:41.133 --> 00:03:42.885
(Ambient music)

00:03:47.348 --> 00:03:49.642
So our Planet City
would allow us to surrender

00:03:49.684 --> 00:03:53.020
almost the entirety
of the globe to nature,

00:03:53.020 --> 00:03:57.233
to return stolen lands
and rewild in our wake.

00:03:57.233 --> 00:04:01.320
A new national park of the world
to be visited and tended,